msgctxt "80"
msgid ""
"Let me know next time you're in Kamurocho, Kiryu-san!\r\n"
"I'll roll out the limo, just for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Heh. Thanks, Nishida."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Oh, and before you go. The boss has been kinda... catty\r\n"
"lately. You might wanna be careful. Who know's what'll set\r\n"
"him off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "It's Nishida, right? What are you up to?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Oh, well the boss had some business with Kashiwagi-san, so\r\n"
"I came over with him. But once we got here... he told me to just go home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"The problem is, if I really do up and leave, I'll totally\r\n"
"get chewed out later. So, I'm sticking around for now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Huh. I was actually heading over to see Majima-san myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Is he still with Kashiwagi-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"Doubt it. The boss thinks meetings are \"the most boring shit\r\n"
"in the world,\" so I doubt it lasted longer than half an hour."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "Then where is he now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"On the roof, most likely. Looking down on the city.\r\n"
"He may not look it, but he's actually a big softie."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "I'm sure he's torn up about you leaving Kamurocho, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"And hey! Don't tell the boss I said he's soft! Think I'd end\r\n"
"up losing an eye myself if he found out..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Heh, I won't. Take care of yourself, Nishida."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Same goes for you, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"Oh, before you go. The boss has been kinda... catty lately.\r\n"
"You might wanna be careful. Who knows what'll set him off?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"You know what? Here, you should take this. Better safe than\r\n"
"sorry, I always say!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Staminan X<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto uno <Color:8>Staminan X<Color:Default>."

